---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>Hello!</h1>
			<p>
				Welcome to <strong>{SITE_TITLE}</strong>! This is my blog, where I share my technical projects and insights. In addition, I'll share anything else I find interesting, like my thoughts on the latest tech trends, photos from my travels, and more.
				I hope you enjoy reading my blog as much as I enjoy writing it!
			</p>
			<p>
				I studied Electrical Engineering at the University of Akron. I received a B.S in electrical Engineering in 2021. Immidiately after graduation, I began my studies as a graduate student at the University of Akron, where I received my M.S in Electrical Engineering in 2023.
				I was a graduate teaching assistant, where I taught undergraduate students Embedded Systems Programming, and Digital Logic Design. I also worked as a graduate research assistant, where I researched and developed a novel method for detecting and classifying faults in 
				electrical power systems using machine learning techniques.
			</p>
			<p>
				Currently, I live in the Greater Cleveland area, where I work as a Test Engineer for a large industrial automation company. I work on a team responsible for creating automated testing systems for our production facilities. This includes 
				designing and implementing test plans, developing test software, electrical and mechanical design, and troubleshooting issues with the test systems. 
				Additionally, I am responsible for maintaining and improving the test systems, and providing technical support for our production facilities. 

				In my free time, I enjoy working on personal projects, learning new technologies, and exploring the outdoors. I also enjoy reading about the latest advancements in technology, and I am always looking for new ways to improve my skills and knowledge.
			</p>

			<p>
				Note: Unless otherwise noted, all content on this site was created by me. Generative AI tools were not used to write any of the content on this site, and all pictures were taken by me. AI was used 
				coding assistance was used for some of the code on this site. 
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
